// A signature algorithm this build cannot compute is refused at configuration, not at the request.
// Accepting the name and then signing with something else would produce a signature the receiver
// reads as valid under an algorithm nobody chose.
// expect: error E0007 at 8:6
// expect: exit 1
use std.http.client

echo client.new("https://svc.test").sign("k1", "s", ["@method"], "none").base_url()
